Here is the commit message:
AMBARI-17772. Kerberos-related configs are not applied before
 INSTALL command is built on add service (rlevas)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the failure to apply Kerberos-related configurations before the INSTALL command was built, which meant that necessary configurations for components transitioning to the INSTALLED state were not set in time, potentially leading to issues with service setup and Kerberos operations.

